{"seq":3,"slug":"license-redemption-flow","title":"兑换/激活与授权绑定流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-digital-goods-delivery/instant-fulfillment/license-redemption-flow","wordCount":1765,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"兑换-激活与授权绑定流程\">兑换/激活与授权绑定流程</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一张卡密在交付给买家时只是一串字符串；把它变成「这个账号可以使用这个软件」的，是兑换与激活。这一步把凭证从<strong>库存对象</strong>变成了<strong>授权对象</strong>，两者的差别在于：库存对象只能被消耗一次，而授权对象有有效期、有绑定关系、可以被吊销、可以被续期。</p>\n<p>兑换（redeem / claim）与激活（activate / bind）是两个不同动作，很多平台把它们混为一谈，代价是丧失了可逆性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>是否可逆</th>\n<th>是否占用凭证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核验（verify）</td>\n<td>查询码是否有效</td>\n<td>可逆（只读）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兑换（redeem）</td>\n<td>把码兑换到某个账号名下</td>\n<td>难（需人工）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>激活（activate）</td>\n<td>在具体设备/环境上启用授权</td>\n<td>是（可解绑）</td>\n<td>否（授权已存在）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权使用（use）</td>\n<td>实际消费授权（如扣减次数）</td>\n<td>视模型</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个划分带来一个重要结论：<strong>兑换应当尽量晚、激活应当尽量可逆</strong>。兑换是不可逆的强绑定，一旦把码兑换到一个错误账号，挽回成本极高；激活是弱绑定，应当允许解绑与换设备。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[输入码] --&gt; B[指纹查询]&#10;  B --&gt; C{状态}&#10;  C --&gt;|available| D[拒绝: 未售出]&#10;  C --&gt;|issued| E{已兑换?}&#10;  C --&gt;|revoked| F[拒绝: 已撤销]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[事务: 绑定账号&lt;br/&gt;写授权记录]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| H{同一账号?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[幂等返回已有授权]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J[拒绝: 已被他人兑换]&#10;  G --&gt; K[授权 activation]&#10;  K --&gt; L[设备绑定/额度初始化]&#10;  L --&gt; M[审计事件]\">graph TD\n  A[输入码] --&gt; B[指纹查询]\n  B --&gt; C{状态}\n  C --&gt;|available| D[拒绝: 未售出]\n  C --&gt;|issued| E{已兑换?}\n  C --&gt;|revoked| F[拒绝: 已撤销]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[事务: 绑定账号&lt;br/&gt;写授权记录]\n  E --&gt;|是| H{同一账号?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[幂等返回已有授权]\n  H --&gt;|否| J[拒绝: 已被他人兑换]\n  G --&gt; K[授权 activation]\n  K --&gt; L[设备绑定/额度初始化]\n  L --&gt; M[审计事件]</pre><h2 id=\"授权数据模型\">授权数据模型</h2><h3 id=\"授权与凭证分离\">授权与凭证分离</h3><p>授权记录必须是独立的实体，因为它有凭证没有的属性（有效期、续期、设备数、状态查询）和更长的生命周期（凭证在 <code>issued</code> 后就静止了，授权会持续演进）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE entitlement (&#10;  id             BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  voucher_id     BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES voucher(id),&#10;  subject_type   TEXT NOT NULL,        -- &#39;user&#39; | &#39;device&#39; | &#39;org&#39;&#10;  subject_id     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  product_code   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  state          TEXT NOT NULL,        -- active|suspended|expired|revoked&#10;  seat_limit     INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,&#10;  activated_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  expires_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  revoked_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  revoke_reason  TEXT,&#10;  CONSTRAINT entitlement_one_per_voucher UNIQUE (voucher_id)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE entitlement_seat (&#10;  entitlement_id BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES entitlement(id),&#10;  device_id      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  bound_at       TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  last_seen_at   TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (entitlement_id, device_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> entitlement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  voucher_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> voucher(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  subject_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'user' | 'device' | 'org'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  subject_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  product_code   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- active|suspended|expired|revoked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  seat_limit     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  activated_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expires_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  revoked_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  revoke_reason  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entitlement_one_per_voucher </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (voucher_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> entitlement_seat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entitlement_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entitlement(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  device_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bound_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  last_seen_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entitlement_id, device_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>entitlement_one_per_voucher</code> 这个唯一约束是兑换幂等的基石：即使兑换请求被重放，第二次插入会在数据库层失败，业务层把它翻译成「已兑换，返回现有授权」而不是报错。这一手法与 <a href=\"post-pay-instant-issuance\">支付成功即时发卡/激活</a> 中履约单的去重是同一模式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"授权状态与吊销语义\">授权状态与吊销语义</h3><p><code>revoked</code> 与 <code>expired</code> 必须分开：前者是平台主动终止（退款、违规、风控），后者是自然到期。混在一起的后果是续期逻辑无法判断一个过期授权该不该恢复——被吊销的授权即使重新付费也不应自动恢复，往往需要人工复核。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一次性兑换码与绑定\">一次性兑换码与绑定</h2><h3 id=\"兑换的原子性\">兑换的原子性</h3><p>兑换本质是「把一个 <code>issued</code> 的凭证绑定到一个 subject」的条件更新，与凭证消耗同构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE voucher&#10;   SET status = &#39;redeemed&#39;, redeemed_by = $1, redeemed_at = now()&#10; WHERE code_fingerprint = $2&#10;   AND status = &#39;issued&#39;&#10;RETURNING id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> voucher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'redeemed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, redeemed_by </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, redeemed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> code_fingerprint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'issued'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING id;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>返回 0 行时有三种可能，必须区分对待而不是统一报「兑换失败」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>返回情况</th>\n<th>真实含义</th>\n<th>对用户的话术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0 行，指纹不存在</td>\n<td>码不存在</td>\n<td>「兑换码无效，请检查输入」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0 行，状态 <code>available</code></td>\n<td>未售出的内部码</td>\n<td>「兑换码无效」（不暴露内部状态）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0 行，状态 <code>redeemed</code> 且 <code>redeemed_by</code> 是自己</td>\n<td>重复提交</td>\n<td>幂等返回已有授权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0 行，状态 <code>redeemed</code> 且是他人</td>\n<td>已被他人使用</td>\n<td>「该兑换码已被使用」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是客诉与风控的交界点：如果同一批码频繁出现「已被他人使用」，可能是撞库得手（见 <a href=\"../fraud-refund-revoke/card-pool-fraud-abuse\">卡密盗刷与薅羊毛防护</a>），应当把这个信号接入风控而不是只回一句提示。</p>\n<h3 id=\"设备绑定的额度管理\">设备绑定的额度管理</h3><p><code>seat_limit</code> 决定了一台授权能绑多少设备。绑定时的并发问题与凭证消耗类似，但有一个额外要求：<strong>解绑必须随时可用</strong>，因为设备换代是常态。一个可行的策略是允许在额度内绑定，超额时提示用户解绑旧设备或提供「最近未活跃设备自动释放」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH candidate AS (&#10;  SELECT device_id FROM entitlement_seat&#10;   WHERE entitlement_id = $1&#10;   ORDER BY last_seen_at NULLS FIRST&#10;   LIMIT 1&#10;), bound AS (&#10;  SELECT count(*) AS n FROM entitlement_seat WHERE entitlement_id = $1&#10;)&#10;INSERT INTO entitlement_seat (entitlement_id, device_id)&#10;SELECT $1, $2 FROM bound, (SELECT seat_limit FROM entitlement WHERE id = $1) e&#10; WHERE bound.n &lt; e.seat_limit&#10;ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING&#10;RETURNING device_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> candidate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entitlement_seat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entitlement_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_seen_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULLS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FIRST</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), bound </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entitlement_seat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entitlement_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entitlement_seat (entitlement_id, device_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bound, (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seat_limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entitlement </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bound</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">seat_limit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONFLICT DO NOTHING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING device_id;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里刻意不自动顶掉旧设备而是返回失败，让前台决定是提示用户还是执行「踢掉最久未用设备」。自动顶掉对用户更友好，但对「家庭共享账号」这类场景会引发纠纷——是否自动顶替应当由业务决定，而不是写死在数据层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"订阅类授权的续期与吊销\">订阅类授权的续期与吊销</h2><h3 id=\"用令牌撤销而不是黑名单\">用令牌撤销而不是黑名单</h3><p>对订阅与 API 授权，平台通常签发一个凭证令牌（access token）让客户端携带。吊销时如果用「黑名单 + 每次请求查黑名单」的方式，会把吊销表变成一个高频读的热点。更标准的做法是让令牌<strong>短时效 + 可刷新</strong>，吊销时撤销刷新令牌：OAuth 2.0 定义了专门的令牌撤销端点（RFC 7009），其语义是「客户端通知授权服务器某个 refresh 或 access token 不再需要」，且撤销一个令牌会连带失效基于同一授权的其他令牌（见 <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7009.txt\">RFC 7009</a>）。落到系统上就是：吊销 → 撤销 refresh token → access token 在分钟级内自然过期 → 不需要逐请求查表。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时间型令牌的时钟问题\">时间型令牌的时钟问题</h3><p>如果授权令牌本身带时间因子（例如 TOTP 用于双因素验证），客户端与服务端的时钟偏移会导致误拒。RFC 6238 定义的 TOTP 是基于 HMAC 的一次性口令扩展，其时间步长默认 30 秒，并允许接收方用「偏移窗口」容忍一定的时钟漂移（见 <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6238.txt\">RFC 6238</a>）。授权系统里凡是依赖时间的判定，都应显式定义一个容忍窗口，并在服务端做时钟同步，而不是假设双方时钟一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"授权查询与对外接口\">授权查询与对外接口</h2><h3 id=\"查询必须廉价\">查询必须廉价</h3><p>客户端每次启动都会查询授权状态，因此这个接口必须是读优先、可缓存、且不依赖凭证明文的。建议的响应结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;entitlement_id&quot;: &quot;e_77120&quot;,&#10;  &quot;product_code&quot;: &quot;example.software.pro&quot;,&#10;  &quot;state&quot;: &quot;active&quot;,&#10;  &quot;seat_limit&quot;: 3,&#10;  &quot;seats_used&quot;: 2,&#10;  &quot;expires_at&quot;: &quot;2027-09-27T00:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;features&quot;: [&quot;offline_mode&quot;, &quot;priority_support&quot;],&#10;  &quot;checked_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T10:20:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ttl_seconds&quot;: 300&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"entitlement_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"e_77120\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"product_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"example.software.pro\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"active\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"seat_limit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"seats_used\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"expires_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-09-27T00:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"features\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"offline_mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"priority_support\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"checked_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T10:20:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ttl_seconds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ttl_seconds</code> 让客户端知道可以缓存多久。一个常见错误是让客户端只在启动时校验一次然后无限期离线使用，这会让吊销完全失效。合理的做法是「短 TTL + 优雅降级」：网络不可用时允许继续使用一段时间（例如 7 天），超时后要求联网校验。这个宽限期是商业决策，但技术上必须可配置，不能硬编码。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>校验频率</th>\n<th>离线宽限</th>\n<th>吊销生效时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>在线 SaaS 功能开关</td>\n<td>每次请求</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>桌面软件授权</td>\n<td>每次启动 + 每 24 小时</td>\n<td>7 天</td>\n<td>最长 7 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动应用内购</td>\n<td>每次启动</td>\n<td>系统商店周期</td>\n<td>依赖商店</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 密钥</td>\n<td>每请求</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>分钟级（短令牌）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>兑换与激活要分开建模：兑换是占用凭证的不可逆强绑定，激活是弱绑定、应当可逆可解绑。</li>\n<li>授权（<code>entitlement</code>）是独立实体，与凭证分离；<code>revoked</code> 与 <code>expired</code> 必须区分，前者不可自动恢复。</li>\n<li>兑换的幂等靠 <code>(voucher_id)</code> 唯一约束实现；返回 0 行时必须区分「码无效 / 未售出 / 已兑换给自己 / 已兑换给他人」四种情形。</li>\n<li>订阅类授权用「短时效令牌 + 撤销刷新令牌」实现吊销（RFC 7009），避免维护高频查询的黑名单。</li>\n<li>授权查询要廉价可缓存，用 <code>ttl_seconds</code> 定义客户端缓存期；离线宽限期是商业决策，必须可配置而非硬编码。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"兑换/激活与授权绑定流程","id":"兑换-激活与授权绑定流程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"授权数据模型","id":"授权数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"授权与凭证分离","id":"授权与凭证分离"},{"level":3,"text":"授权状态与吊销语义","id":"授权状态与吊销语义"},{"level":2,"text":"一次性兑换码与绑定","id":"一次性兑换码与绑定"},{"level":3,"text":"兑换的原子性","id":"兑换的原子性"},{"level":3,"text":"设备绑定的额度管理","id":"设备绑定的额度管理"},{"level":2,"text":"订阅类授权的续期与吊销","id":"订阅类授权的续期与吊销"},{"level":3,"text":"用令牌撤销而不是黑名单","id":"用令牌撤销而不是黑名单"},{"level":3,"text":"时间型令牌的时钟问题","id":"时间型令牌的时钟问题"},{"level":2,"text":"授权查询与对外接口","id":"授权查询与对外接口"},{"level":3,"text":"查询必须廉价","id":"查询必须廉价"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"凭证交付安全（脱敏/查看限制）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-digital-goods-delivery/instant-fulfillment/delivery-credential-security"},"next":{"title":"数字商品 B2C 增值税与 OSS/IOSS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-digital-goods-delivery/digital-tax-region/digital-vat-oss-ioss"}}